I am guessing that this might be related to the gnat problem below...

> gnat-4.4 (The ada compiler) is also refusing to build.

I should've taken both gnat and gcj through the multiarch transition  
when I did libc/gcc.

Unfortunately I did not keep a copy of the midway point of the  
transition. I think that means I have to rebuild an earlier version of  
glibc and gcc that have partial multiarch.  Then build gcj and gnat at  
semi-multiarch aware. Then upgrade libc and gcc to full multiarch.   
Then rebuild gcj and gnat to full multiarch versions.

Bugger.

Cheers
Michael.



